      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MISS KARIS (3) was a (19.71) winner last time out at this track from Box 3. Has a strong record out of this box with two wins and a minor placing from three starts. Looks the testing material. DELIGHTFUL RAIN (2) showed little early speed at her last couple, the latest finishing fifth (20.56) in a T3 Grade 7 at Traralgon. Has ability and a bold showing is expected. MINTER DELICIOUS (5) drew a squeeze box and was game in defeat when a close second, 1.2 lengths from the winner Mum's Tonka (19.76) at this track. The form out of the last run is proven to be strong. Hard to beat again. HIGHGATE FRANKY (1) can improve on an unplaced run here last time out.",
